.208, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 102.0}, {"t": 102.708, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 102.5}, {"t": 103.209, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 103.0}, {"t": 103.708, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 103.5}, {"t": 104.208, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 104.0}, {"t": 104.708, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 104.5}, {"t": 105.208, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 105.0}, {"t": 105.708, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 105.5}, {"t": 106.209, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 106.0}, {"t": 106.708, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 106.5}, {"t": 107.208, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 107.0}, {"t": 107.708, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 107.5}, {"t": 108.208, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 108.0}, {"t": 108.708, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 108.5}, {"t": 109.208, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 109.0}, {"t": 109.708, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 109.5}, {"t": 110.208, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 110.0}, {"t": 110.707, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 110.5}, {"t": 111.208, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 111.0}, {"t": 111.708, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 111.5}, {"t": 112.209, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 112.0}, {"t": 112.708, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 112.5}, {"t": 113.208, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 113.0}, {"t": 113.707, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 113.5}, {"t": 114.208, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 114.0}, {"t": 114.613, "kind": "inputTranscription", "text": "小林 は 「 乗客 は 電車 が 創造 する 」 と いう 言葉 を 掲げ た 。 箕面 や 宝塚 に は 遊覧 施設 を 作り 、 池田 に は 日本 初 の 郊外 型 分譲 住宅 地 ・ 池田 新市街 、 後 の 室町 住宅 を 作っ た 。"}, {"t": 114.707, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 114.5}, {"t": 114.912, "kind": "outputTranscription", "text": "邊走邊思考。他認為人應該生活在空氣清新的郊區，而不是污染日益嚴重的市中心。小林提出「乘客由電車創造」的口號。他在箕面和寶塚建造了遊樂設施，在池田建造了日本第一個郊區型出售住宅區——池田新市街，也就是後來的室町住宅。"}, {"t": 114.912, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 17960}, {"t": 114.923, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 12800}, {"t": 115.027, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 23040}, {"t": 115.112, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 20480}, {"t": 115.2, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 20480}, {"t": 115.208, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 115.0}, {"t": 115.286, "kind": "audioOut", "n": 20480},